{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-02_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-02","title":"雨の中を歩く","storyCode":"4-2","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-02_end.txt","sourceHash":"5ebe7c8910cfb51da3ea530a289b11e76e03a86f5c28d6604de70022275f8775","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_r"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"あっ！　そ、そこどいてっ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"きゃっ！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ご、ごめんなさい！　ぶつかるつもりじゃなかったんだけど……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ううん、大丈夫。そうしてすぐに謝れるなんて、立派だね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"わわ、そうかな？　えへへ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ところで、お姉さんはここで何してるの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"この辺は雨が降ってるし、雨宿りしたほうがいいんじゃない……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ええっと……ううん、その……少しお散歩してただけだから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"それより君、何か手伝ってほしいことがあるんじゃない？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"えっ！　どうしてわかったの！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ふふっ、ないしょ。これはお姉さんの秘密だからね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ええ～？　……んー、まあいっか！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"じゃあさ、お願いがあるんだけど――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"うーん……でも、やっぱり無理かなあ……お姉さん、背が小さいし……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"もう、そんなこと言っちゃダメだよ！　君に比べたら、私のほうが背が高いでしょ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"わわ、ごめんって！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"それじゃ……とりあえず、やってみる？　えっとね、この板どかすのを手伝ってほしいんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"下敷きになってる蓄音機を持って帰りたくてさ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"これ？　うん、やってみよっか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"じゃあいくよ。いち……にの……さん！　えいっ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"！　できた！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……っ、これは……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"わあっ、お姉さん力持ちだね！　ありがとう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"うん、でも……この蓄音機、壊れてるみたいだよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大丈夫大丈夫！　見つけた時にはもう壊れてたしね。いつか、これをちゃんと直して使えるようにするつもりなんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"実は僕、みんなのためにレコードをいっぱい集めててさ。まあ、自分でも、一度も聴いたことないんだけど……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"でも、いつかみんなに聴かせてあげようと思って！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……難しい目標のはずなのに、簡単なことみたいに口に出せるなんて……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……私、何のために行動してるのかな。……私にできることって、何だろう……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……あのさ、お姉さんは僕のこと、怖くないの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ううん。……どうして、怖がられると思ったの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"だって僕、鉱石病なんだよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あははっ、私もそうだよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"え～っ！　こんなに可愛いのに感染者なんて、もったいない……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者になったからって、全部台無しになるわけじゃないんだよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"だって、たとえ君が感染者でも、そうじゃなくても――いい子でいたなら、その事実までは変わらないでしょう？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ん～……そうなの？　よくわかんないや……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（ぐう……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……もしかして、お腹ぺこぺこ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……うん……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……じゃあ、これあげる。って言っても、これしかないんだけど……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"えっ、いいの？　やった、ありがとう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……あれ？　そういえば……お姉さんって、なんでここに来たの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"それは……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……私が……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ある人と、約束したからなんだ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――お姉さん、またね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"うん、またね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あの子みたいな子供でも、結局、最後には……"},{"type":"narration","text":"感染者め。お前たちはもう、人ではない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私にできることを、もっと……もっと考えないと……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……どうして……全員を守ることは、できないんだろう……"},{"type":"narration","text":"お前にできるはずがない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"そんな……"},{"type":"narration","text":"飢餓、迫害、そしていずれ訪れる凄惨な死……\n感染者の末路など、ほかにはない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"そんなこと、ない……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ロドスが、感染者のために立ち続ける限り……！"},{"type":"narration","text":"お前は数少ない恵まれた人間の一人だ。そんなことを言えるのは、そのためでしかない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"違う……！　多くの人が団結して、同じ目標に向かって努力し続けているからこそ、私は……！"},{"type":"narration","text":"この大地は、すでに麻痺してしまったんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……いいえ、まだそうはなってない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者を、絶望の淵に追いやらせはしない……！"},{"type":"narration","text":"アーミヤ。\n怒りに身を任せるが良い。\nただのそれだけで――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……ダメ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"絶対に……そんなこと、しない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"だって、私は……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あの人と、約束したんだから――！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"この声は……？"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_31_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あのお姉ちゃんが教えてくれたんだ。このお人形は、誰かのために作るから意味があるんだよ、って！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"だからね、これ、龍のお姉ちゃんのために作ったの！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性の声","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"今聞こえたのって、もしかして……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"やっぱり、あの後ろ姿は――"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_31_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"チェンさん？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――――――――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――――！　――――――！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――――――――！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性の声","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――――――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"ん……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_r"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あの、チェン隊長……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_31_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ここで、何をしていらしたんですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"なんというか、私はてっきり……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"キミには関係ないだろう。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"単に、龍門の問題は、すべて私の管轄下にあるというだけの話だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_r"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……チェン隊長……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_31_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"初めて見た……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"彼女が、あんな目をしているところなんて……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ","女の子","女性の声"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["チェン"]}]}
